<p>To secure it with RLS, you’d configure the following rules:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full" data-has-filename="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> TABLE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> projects </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ENABLE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> ROW</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> LEVEL</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SECURITY</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Create policy for selecting own records</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">CREATE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> POLICY</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> select_own_records </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ON</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> public.projects</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">FOR</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SELECT</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">USING</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> ((</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">select</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> owner_user_id </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> auth.user_id()));</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="8"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Create policy for inserting rows</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">CREATE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> POLICY</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> insert_policy </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ON</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> public.projects</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="10"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">FOR</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> INSERT</span></span>
